  - { name: "Superior Sense of Smell", description: "Follows a scent trail up to four days (96 hours) old, and smells odors not sealed airtight up to 12 inches (0.3 m) underground and two feet (0.6 m) under snow. The Dog Boy''s printed skills, each raised +6% by the Sniffer''s Tracking Bonus: common and strong scents 70% +3% per level (76% for the Sniffer), range 100 feet (30.5 m) per level; identify specific odors 54% +2% per level (60%), range 25 feet (7.6 m) per level, needing familiarity with the subject or a reference sample; track by smell alone 40% +4% per level (46%), with only HALF the usual penalties to strike, parry and dodge when blinded or in total darkness. Roll once per 1000 feet (305 m) of trail, half that for a faint scent or light rain or snow; after a failure, two successes in three tries find the trail again and two failures lose it. Cannot track through water, nor smell Astral Beings, ghosts or energy beings." }
