  - { name: "Endurance", description: "Twice a human''s for resisting fatigue and lifting. Carries 20 times P.S. in pounds with a P.S. under 17, 40 times with 17 or higher, and lifts twice what it carries. Works at an intense, even pace for two hours before fatigue sets in, and sustains all-out running or fierce hand to hand combat for 40 minutes. Exhausted: -2 Spd, -2 initiative, -2 damage, -1 strike, parry and dodge, doubled for each further 15 minutes without rest; recovers in about 15 minutes of rest or light work." }
  - { name: "Sensitivity to Ley Line Energy", description: "On a ley line or near a nexus the psychic and supernatural sensing abilities are impaired or wiped out and cannot be used to find magic or supernatural prey; smell and the other physical senses are unaffected, and the other psychic sensitive powers are enhanced as usual. Ley line storms bring headaches, crackling in the ears and static shocks, and the dog is twice as likely to be struck by ley line energy and lightning." }
